        'TURKISH NOUN COMPOUNDS TAKE THE POSSESSIVE ON THE HEAD NOUN (izafet): "landing gear test" is "iniş takımı testi", "metals automation" is "metal otomasyonu". A label or bullet ending in a bare "test", "otomasyon" or "montaj" with no suffix is ungrammatical. Conversely, do not strand a possessive on a coordinated item that is not the head: "yedek parça ve analitik", not "yedek parça ve analitiği".',
