        'STATUTORY AND LEGAL PAGE NAMES HAVE FIXED TURKISH EQUIVALENTS, NOT LITERAL ONES, AND A DEFINED TERM IS A FROZEN STRING: Imprint/Impressum = "Künye" (never "Yasal uyarı"); Terms = "Kullanım koşulları" (never bare "Koşullar"); Privacy Policy = "Gizlilik politikası"; Cookie Policy = "Çerez politikası". Declare a defined term once and repeat it character for character; every "WHEREAS" takes one rendering; "Name:" is "Ad Soyad:" and "Date:" is "Tarih:". Never drop or renumber a clause number.',
